## 3.4 Web app
- [x] No login by design; add an optional `-basic-auth-file` for people without a proxy, or make the warning impossible to miss (-auth-file / ZORTEX_AUTH, and a warning) @p2 @size(sm) @done(2026-10-13)
- [x] Project pages: progress, next tasks, key results, log, calendar history @p3 @size(md) @done(2026-10-16)
- [ ] Domain views (Wishlist # 6 phase 4): OKR progress, weekly review @p3 @size(lg)
